  "properties": {
    "title": "QGIS and Democracy - Defining New Zealand\u2019s Electoral Boundaries",
    "description": "How QGIS was used to help review and define New Zealand's electoral boundaries.\n\nThis year the Representation Commission reviewed and updated New Zealand\u2019s electoral boundaries. This talk will give a high-level overview on the process and describe how a QGIS plugin was the core decision making tool that enabled the Commission to quickly investigate different boundary scenarios and ensure electorates were within legislated population tolerances.",
